{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Limits of Responsible Innovation.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Limits of Responsible Innovation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"limits of responsible innovation limits of responsible innovation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Limits of Responsible Innovation.md","fileName":"Limits of Responsible Innovation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Limits of Responsible Innovation","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Governance and Responsible Innovation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Governance and Responsible Innovation","Responsible Innovation","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Limits of Responsible Innovation.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Limits of Responsible Innovation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"limits of responsible innovation limits of responsible innovation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Limits of Responsible Innovation.md","fileName":"Limits of Responsible Innovation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Limits of Responsible Innovation","heading":"Limits of Responsible Innovation","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The limits of responsible innovation appear when ethical design methods assume that a proposed technology will be built and ask only how to make it acceptable. Under that assumption, ethics can become a lubricant for development or a public justification for business as usual.\n\nSome applications may be too unreliable, harmful, or illegitimate to deploy. A genuine ethical process must preserve the option to pause, reject, or redirect a project. It must also acknowledge that values cannot always be fully articulated as design requirements and that consequences emerge through social use. [[Responsible Innovation]] is strongest when it retains this critical space.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Governance and Responsible Innovation","Responsible Innovation","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Limits of Responsible Innovation.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Limits of Responsible Innovation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"limits of responsible innovation limits of responsible innovation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Limits of Responsible Innovation.md","fileName":"Limits of Responsible Innovation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Limits of Responsible Innovation","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[aiethics.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Governance and Responsible Innovation","Responsible Innovation","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}